      "name": "Tri Agung",
      "created_at": "2025-11-26T06:41:40.727Z",
      "cooked": "<p>How do I set up Frappe CRM like this?</p>\n<p>Manager: Can view, edit, or delete all leads and deals.</p>\n<p>User: Can only view or edit leads and deals assigned to the user, or leads that haven’t been assigned to anyone else with a new or open status. And can’t view or modify leads/deals assigned to other users.</p>\n<p>I’ve tried various user permission settings but haven’t found the one I want.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/7/7/77747579b43da97a34104b4f99ade5426af4da5c.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/77747579b43da97a34104b4f99ade5426af4da5c\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/7/77747579b43da97a34104b4f99ade5426af4da5c_2_690x432.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"h2KkwmMtozv0fWQRCizCMEdrJI8\" width=\"690\" height=\"432\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/7/77747579b43da97a34104b4f99ade5426af4da5c_2_690x432.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/7/77747579b43da97a34104b4f99ade5426af4da5c_2_1035x648.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/7/7/77747579b43da97a34104b4f99ade5426af4da5c.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FAFAFA\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1284×804 47.1 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
